WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.752
Come on.

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:05.797
It's time for another chapter
of my rags-to-riches life story.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:13.013
Welcome to Acapulco.

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.849
Now, everyone, get to work.

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:22.606
Memo was finally working
at the pool with me.

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:26.443
Chad and Julia
made their engagement official.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:28.278
But I was happy for them

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:31.240
because I had my eyes on someone new.

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.075
Maximo.

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:37.162
So, what's Maximo's deal?

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:39.540
I think he's Mexican.

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:43.502
I didn't know it yet,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.422
but everything
was about to change for me.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:50.092
Do you always
have to make things a mystery?

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.552
I don't know.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:53.303
Do I?

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:54.805
Anyway...

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.476
A dark time in my life was approaching.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:05.691
My family was at risk
of losing everything.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:10.821
But sometimes things have to break apart
to come back stronger.

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:23.792
Life doesn't always take you
where you think you should go.

00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:30.257
But it has a way of leading you
to where you should be.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.481
Happiness is about
finding where you belong.

00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.784
Will the owner
of the whitest ass in Mexico

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.536
please come to the front desk.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:02.581
Who's messing with the PA?

00:02:03.707 --> 00:02:05.501
Hey. Not funny.

